# Sunstaff Mesa (CIPlay sunstaff_mesa): the plan Relic of the Seventh Tide's second island (in Balboa's place), quest
# "The Map Room". The slot canyon up x 0 from z -80 (1.6 m), the camp 7..12 -68..-63, the vines across z -50, the
# oasis round 0 -24 (2 m, the well 0 -28), the stair z -16..5 up to 12 m; the map room x -9..9 z 15..33 on top (the
# lens -7.4 17.5, mirrors -6.6 21.5 / -0.6 21.5 / -0.6 26.3, the mark panel 7.4 26.3, the stand -4.5 31.6).
island Sunstaff Mesa
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Map Room
wait 3
zone canyon_mouth
expect step 1
read Kett's camp diary
expect step 2
open Kett's camp trunk
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect item Machete 1
expect step 4
expect hidden stairzone
use canyonvines
expect hidden canyonvines
expect shown stairzone
walk 0 -58 to 0 -50 to 0 -42 h=1.6
zone canyon_stair
expect step 5
expect animals Warthog 4
kill Warthog
expect step 6
walk 0 -18 to 0 -10 to 0 -2 to 0 6 to 0 12 h=12
zone map_room
expect step 7
use mirror1
use mirror1
use mirror1
use mirror1
expect story beamset 0
use journalstand
expect story sunangle 1
expect step 8
beam sunlens
use mirror1
wait 1
beam sunlens
use mirror2
wait 1
beam sunlens
use mirror3
wait 2
beam sunlens
expect story beamset 1
expect shown burnedmark
expect step 9
read Burned mark
expect step 10
open Map room cache
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_Fueltank 1
expect item Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel 1
expect step 13
walk 0 2 to 0 -10 to 0 -20 to 1 -26 h=2
zone oasis_well
expect step 14
expect hidden workshop
use windlass
expect shown workshop
open Workshop locker
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor 1
expect done
